 "summary": "Dataflow language of Apache Pig, developed at Yahoo! Research, in which scripts are sequences of relational-style steps (LOAD, FILTER, FOREACH...GENERATE, GROUP, COGROUP, JOIN) over a nested data model of tuples, bags and maps, compiled to MapReduce, Tez or Spark jobs.",
 "status": "maintained",
 "defined_by": [
  "reference-implementation",
  "academic-paper"
 ],
